        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alex Hirsch, Matt Chapman, Tim McKeon, Joe Pitt, John Aoshima\n- Works: Dreamscaperers, Gravity Falls\n- Organizations: Disney Television Animation, Disney Channel, Disney XD\n- Topics: Writing, Directing, Television production, Broadcast dates\n\nFacts:\n- Gravity Falls is an American animated television series produced by Disney Television Animation.\n- Gravity Falls originally aired on Disney Channel and later on Disney XD from June 15, 2012 to February 15, 2016.\n- Alex Hirsch is the series creator of Gravity Falls.\n- The Dreamscaperers episode was written by Alex Hirsch, Matt Chapman, and Tim McKeon.\n- The Dreamscaperers episode was directed by Joe Pitt and John Aoshima.",
